{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the roaring 1898 frontier expansion lies the cries of those who are left behind. Follow the disgraced ex-ranger, The Drifter, on his path to redemption as he attempts to root out the corruption of a failing state. Acting as his unexpected partner is The Enforcer, a bold ranger scout with dreams of an equitable future. Together, they'll leverage the lessons of a tragic past and the ambitions of a hopeful tomorrow to overcome a present rife with outlaws and obstinate officers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate immersive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your allies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke it out in hectic brawls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the timing for tense quickdraws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the perfect shot to sack a faraway foe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLORFUL COMPANIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against stacked odds, grit your teeth and stand tall alongside fierce comrades. Spend time with them throughout your campaign to bolster bonds and witness their growth on and off the battlefield.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824630?t=1760037027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824630?t=1760037027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/eb198e89abbc6c3ce234105930ac1066565c5927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760037027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/eb198e89abbc6c3ce234105930ac1066565c5927/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760037027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the roaring 1898 frontier expansion lies the cries of those who are left behind. Follow the disgraced ex-ranger, The Drifter, on his path to redemption as he attempts to root out the corruption of a failing state. Acting as his unexpected partner is The Enforcer, a bold ranger scout with dreams of an equitable future. Together, they'll leverage the lessons of a tragic past and the ambitions of a hopeful tomorrow to overcome a present rife with outlaws and obstinate officers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate immersive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your allies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke it out in hectic brawls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the timing for tense quickdraws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the perfect shot to sack a faraway foe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLORFUL COMPANIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against stacked odds, grit your teeth and stand tall alongside fierce comrades. Spend time with them throughout your campaign to bolster bonds and witness their growth on and off the battlefield.</p>","developers":["Eric Ramos"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/30c90ba9b82a2ad27b6de5cc80107a7fa2fb7c11/header.jpg?t=1760037027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3824630/780590095/ac36d8d11e6bb838c62637d0361fc5508318f77b/1759412490/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759415201","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr